id: pm-obq2
title: "Scorecard Code-Review (0→10): approved-review discipline for merged changesets"
description: Establish a sustainable approved-review discipline for agent-authored changes and decide whether repository rules should enforce one human approval.
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: code-review,governance,scorecard,security
