estimated_minutes: 45
acceptance_criteria: A workable review flow is decided and documented (maintainer approves agent-lane PRs via GitHub review before merge; bot reviews do not count); ruleset optionally enforces 1 approving review; Code-Review score trends toward 10 over the rolling 30-changeset window; decision recorded here
