comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-18T12:39:30.928Z",codex-gpt5,"GitHub report evidence 2026-07-18: open Scorecard CodeReviewID alert #20 is high severity on refs/heads/main with no file-specific location. Canonical remediation remains this item; PR #593 itself uses exact-head automated review and thread acknowledgement."
  "2026-07-26T09:09:13.277Z","harness:codex","Repository-side decision: independent human approval is the target for security-sensitive changes, while bot reviews remain defense in depth and are never represented as human approval. A one-approval rule is intentionally deferred because the repository currently has one active human maintainer and enforcing it would deadlock maintenance; enable it, including administrators, when a second trusted maintainer is active. Public policy is in docs/SECURITY_GOVERNANCE.md and CONTRIBUTING.md."
  "2026-07-26T09:11:10.016Z","harness:codex","PR evidence: the documented independent-review decision ships in PR #735 at head 39acfef6; item remains open and unclaimed because the remaining progress requires another human maintainer."
  "2026-07-26T11:32:39.333Z","harness:claude-code","Live Scorecard alert state 2026-07-26: code-scanning alert #20 (CodeReviewID, security_severity high) is open on this repository and is this item's meter. Confirms the check is still at 0 after the pm-gnzh program's other children landed; no new item filed per the alert-mapping convention."
